      "mechanism_id": "spin_temperature_balance",
      "statement": "The inverse nuclear spin temperature under dynamic polarization is determined by the balance of energy fluxes from electrons to the nuclear Zeeman and spin-spin reservoirs, leading to a Lorentzian-like dependence on magnetic field.",
