          "support": "In the limit of long correlation time, Phi becomes 1/2, T_1eN = 3 tau_c / 2, and the inverse nuclear spin temperature is beta = 4 <S_z> B / (hbar gamma_N) / (B^2 + (tau_c / T_2e*)^2 * B_L^2 / 4)."
